Description: fast desktop file search tool
 Seeker finds files by name and by content. Name patterns can be wildcards
 or regular expressions; content searches use the ripgrep engine and support
 plain text, regular expressions, case sensitivity and whole-word matching.
 .
 Results show matching lines with context. Searches can be limited by size
 and modification date, respect .gitignore files, skip binary files, and be
 exported to CSV or text. A --cli mode runs the same search in a terminal.
